   "heading": "Sajo-Jirugi No1 (15 movements)",
   "items": [
    "Starts from parallel ready stance, alternating right and left walking stances toward points A, B, C and D; each step pairs a middle obverse punch with a low outer forearm block; finishes in parallel ready stance."
   ]
  },
  {
   "heading": "Sajo-Jirugi No2 (15 movements)",
   "items": [
    "Same footwork as No1, but the low outer forearm blocks are replaced by middle inner forearm blocks."
   ]
  }
